_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "153005"} "1896"] "\n" [:option {:value "153130"} "1906"] "\n" [:option {:value "153294"} "1920"] "\n" [:option {:value "153361"} "1924"] "\n" [:option {:value "153420"} "1928"] "\n" [:option {:value "153459"} "1932"] "\n" [:option {:value "153541"} "1936"] "\n" [:option {:value "153626"} "1948"] "\n" [:option {:value "153697"} "1952"] "\n" [:option {:value "153769"} "1956"] "\n" [:option {:value "153874"} "1960"] "\n" [:option {:value "154007"} "1964"] "\n" [:option {:value "154150"} "1968"] "\n" [:option {:value "154282"} "1972"] "\n" [:option {:value "154368"} "1976"] "\n" [:option {:value "154446"} "1980"] "\n" [:option {:value "154565"} "1984"] "\n" [:option {:value "154647"} "1988"] "\n" [:option {:value "154755"} "1992"] "\n" [:option {:value "154878"} "1996"] "\n" [:option {:value "155007"} "2000"] "\n" [:option {:value "155135"} "2004"] "\n" [:option {:value "258960"} "2008"] "\n" [:option {:value "308000"} "2012"] "\n" [:option {:value "356740"} "2016"] "\n" [:option {:value "19001700"} "2020"] "\n" [:option {:value "2003680"} "2024"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/211"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "Road Race, Individual, Men" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} " 7 July 1912 — 2:00"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/233"} "Stockholms Olympiastadion, Stockholm"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/153233"} "123 from 16 countries"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Format"] [:td {:colspan "2"} "315.385 km. (196.0 miles) individual time trial."]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "The race was a mammoth time trial of over 315 km (196 miles) on the Mälaren Rundt course around Stockholm. The individual and " [:a {:href "/results/153234"} "team road race"] " events were held concurrently, with the team event based on the times of the best four finishing individual riders for each team."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The riders were sent off at two minute intervals, with the last scheduled rider starting at 7 AM (0700).  Of the 151 entrants, only 123 riders eventually started.  The individual event was won by " [:a {:href "/athletes/15318"} "Rudolph “Okey” Lewis"] " of South Africa.  He started quickly and led by 11½ minutes at 120 km.  Increasing the lead to 17 minutes at 200 km, he slowed slightly coming in, but still won by almost nine minutes over " [:a {:href "/athletes/14581"} "Freddie Grubb"] " of Great Britain.  As the second starter, going off at 2:02 AM, he was the first overall finisher as well.  Little is known about Lewis’ cycling career, even by South African experts.  It was noted that the weather at the start time of 2 AM was cool, with no wind, which favored the very early starters.  By 7 AM, a strong westerly wind was blowing directly into the faces of the later starting riders.  As the second starter, Lewis definitely benefited from his start position."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The previous record for the Mälaren Rundt was 11-22:07.0, set in 1909 by " [:a {:href "/athletes/15744"} "Henrik Morén"] " of Sweden, a 10-time winner of the race, including nine consecutive wins from 1902-1910.  In 1912, Morén also won the Swedish selecting competition held on this track, in 11-56:23.  Lewis lowered the record by almost 41 minutes.  No less than 16 riders, including Morén himself, in 15th place, bettered the previous record."] "\n\n" [:p {} "In addition to the Olympic medals, a Diploma of Merit was given to cyclists who finished within 25% of the winner’s time.  As Lewis finished in 10-42:39, all riders under 13-23:18.8 qualified, and thus 81 of the 94 riders who finished received this special diploma."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Bib"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/15318"} "Rudolph Lewis"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/RSA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/RSA.png"}] "RSA"]] [:td {} "10-42:39.0"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/14581"} "Freddie Grubb"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "GBR"]] [:td {} "10-51:24.2"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/16515"} "Carl Schutte"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "10-52:38.8"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/15633"} "Leon Meredith"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "GBR"]] [:td {} "11-00:02.6"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "5"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/13734"} "Frank Brown"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CAN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: midd